{
  "id": "ISA.55",
  "number": "55",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaia 55",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "55",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 55"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "55",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaberuroikab arorutiet ne leel ne kiyai Jehovah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee chi age tugul ne amei melel, obwanjin beek, koboto inendet ne matinyei feda; obwa anyun, oal ak oam; ee, obwa, oal divaik ak chego ama eng’ feda anan eng’ alyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nee si oboisie feda eng’ tuguk che ma amitwogik? Ak boisieng’wong’ agobo tuguk che mobiyonyi? Oepcha it mising’, si oam che miach, ak ingoboiboitu sobonwekwok eng’ che akwaen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oeb it, ak obwanja, ogas, si kosopcho sobonwekwok: ak kiyomisyige ak okwek kayomiset ne bo koigeny, noto rirenosiek che bo iman, che bo Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, kiagoite inendet koek aboriat eng’ bororiosiek, koek kandoindet, ak ko ng’atindet ne bo bororiosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keero, iguure bororiet ne mengen, ak kolabatyin bororiet ne kima kongenin, amu Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, ak amu Inendet ne Tilil ne bo Israel; amu kigotororin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocheng’ Jehovah kota kimuchi kenyor, oguur kota ko negit: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ingometo kiptengekyot orennyi, ak ingometo inendet ne ma bo iman, kabwatutikyik: ak ingoweekyigei Jehovah, si korire; ak ingoweekyigei Kamuktaindennyo, amu nyochin kaat iman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ma chekwok kabwatutikyuk, ama chechuk ortinwekwok, mwaei Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ko u ye toror kipsengwetisiek kosiir ng’ony, ko u noto tororen ortinwekyuk kosiir ortinwekwok, ak ko tororen kabwatutikyuk kosiir kabwatutikwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ko u ye roboni ak kobuti teluchi kobunu kipsengwet, ama weektagei oloto kogeny, ago ibisi ng’ony, ak kogochi tuguk kobityo ak kong’atyo, ak kogochi keswek letaindet, ak kogochi amitwogik chito ne amei; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "u noto ng’olyondennyu ne mong’une kutinnyu: maweekyinagei buch, ago yaei kosulda kit ne amache, ak koborei eng’ kit ne kiayoktochine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu tun omandoi eng’ boiboiyet, ak kindoiywok eng’ kalyet: tiendos eng’ taing’wong’ tulonok ak tulonok che mengechen, ak koraprab eunekwak ketik tugul che bo timin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bitei biribiriet kogeeri katok, ak kobit myrtle kogeer katablelinik: ak kibwate kainetab Jehovah, koek kaborunet ne bo koigeny ne magiistoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
